does he want to help this girl so much why do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:12.240
you want to help this girl so much and to me maybe&nbsp;
this was wrong but I just felt like if I went and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:16.480
spelled it out that would sort of cheapen it I was&nbsp;
like I don't know he just feels this compulsion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:23.440
but by leaving it open that's what I made the&nbsp;
